<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<th style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;">
<p class="h2" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #0071c5; line-height: 19px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><span class="eloquaemail"></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
{!Contact.FirstName},<br> <br>
Welcome to Intel® Partner Alliance Cloud Data Center Specialty Benefits! As a qualified Cloud Data Center Specialist, you are eligible for specialty benefits* that are designed to help you grow your cloud business, including:<br>
</p><ul style="font-size: 11px;">
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Cloud Data Center Specialist designation</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Intel promotion of your company as a Cloud Specialist</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Customer matchmaking opportunities</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Additional points when purchasing Intel® Server Products for Cloud</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Access to Intel Cloud Resources</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Priority invitations to industry events and training sessions</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Access to Intel® Platform Testing Services</li>
</ul>
<p>To get started, please reply to <a href="mailto:ITP-CLOUD@intel.com">ITP-CLOUD@intel.com</a> with the following information:</p>
<p><li style="font-size: 11px;">Primary contact for Cloud Specialist communications</li>
	<div>Name: </div>
	<div style="margin-bottom: 10px">Email: </div>
</P>
<p><li style="font-size: 11px;">For additional sales and promotion materials</li>
<div>Physical Mailing Address: </div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 10px">Phone: </div>
</p>
<P><table style="padding: 0px; width: auto; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;">
<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<td style="background-color: #00aeef; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; border-radius: 3px; border: currentColor; text-align: center !important; color: #fefefe; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-word-wrap: break-word; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><a style="margin: 0px; padding: 5px 0px; border-radius: 3px; border: 0px solid #00aeef; text-align: left; color: #fefefe; line-height: 1.3; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;" href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/partner-alliance/membership/specialties/cloud/overview.html">Access benefits</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></P>
<P>*Benefits may vary by geography.</P>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Intel partners have a long history of innovation, and with Intel Partner Alliance, we’ll help you accelerate building solutions for the data centric economy. Together, we can connect, innovate, and grow, making extraordinary opportunities possible.</P>
<P>Visit <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/partner-alliance/help/overview.html">intel.com/partnerhelp</a> for help and guidance on optimizing your membership.</P>
<br>
Thank you,<br>
Your Intel® Partner Alliance team</p>
